# Hunt of the Black Lion (Q333), the statue run: a level 25 human mystic holding the Black Lion
# mark accepts at Sophya and takes her first letter. An Ol Mahum guerilla of another ground drops
# nothing; a Neer crawler drops the twentieth undead ash and a first cargo box (both rolls 0).
# Redfoot refuses to open the box without 650 adena; Sophya pays 700 adena and a lion claw for the
# ashes and trades ten claws for a lion eye and fifty spiritshots (roll 30). Redfoot opens the first
# box (rolls 80 and 10, the even roll true) into the statue's head, which completes the statue
# pieces; Rupio assembles it (even roll true) and Undrias buys it for 30000 adena. Redfoot's gossip
# (roll 7) costs 200 adena and counts one, Morgan buys the second box for 100 adena and a guild
# coin, and Sophya takes the letter back and ends the repeatable quest for 12400 adena; then
# relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
